From a3f4b58785a515e26e0ceb3331f1fbbaf29285e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 18:04:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Train B, B4: seven of Rob's cards -- attack requirements and
 defender as statics, haste for abilities, an unless that returns a creature,
 a top card's abilities

Conspicuous Snoop, Realmwalker, Felothar the Steadfast, Weathered Sentinels, Goblin Rabblemaster,
Thousand-Year Elixir and Faerie Impostor, each with scenarios.

- Attack requirements (CR 508.1d): static attacks-each-combat (Goblin Rabblemaster), read by
  rules/combat.mjs; the declare-attackers record says which creatures must attack (requires),
  the controller refuses a declaration that leaves one out with what to do, and the engine
  refuses it again. Creatures that can attack only capped planeswalkers count as many as can
  attack at once (a matching). The house pilot, the random pilot and the scenario runner meet
  requirements (meetRequirements, house-pilot.mjs, pure).
- Defender lifted (CR 702.3b): defenderLifted in rules/statics.mjs; a static attacks-despite-
  defender for creatures you control (Felothar), or against the players who attacked you during
  their last turn (Weathered Sentinels; attackedPlayers kept per player, from none as each of
  their turns begins), never toward a planeswalker.
- Activate as though it had haste (CR 702.10c): static activate-as-though-haste, read by
  sickForAbilities wherever a {T} ability is offered or paid (Thousand-Year Elixir).
- unlessPays returnToHand (Faerie Impostor; CR 118.12a): each other creature its own option.
- The sacrificed creature's power and toughness (Felothar; CR 608.2h): the cost's last known
  information kept on the ability, amounts powerOf/toughnessOf "sacrificed".
- A top card's activated abilities (Conspicuous Snoop; CR 613.1f): apply.topCardAbilities.

check-cards: 1,621 definitions, 2,537 scenarios, 0 failed. Not defined here: Maralen, Fae
Ascendant; Primary Research; Relic Retriever; Lorehold Archivist // Restore Relic.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0117w9NgFp5PywoLmnpLsKQf
